			"hadithnumber": 4047,
			"arabicnumber": 4047,
			"text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“The Hour will not begin until wealth becomes abundant and tribulations appear, and Harj increases.” They said: “What is Harj, O Messenger of Allah?” He said: “Killing, killing, killing,” three times",
